---
import '../../styles/operations.css';
import '../../styles/workspace.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <title>Sign in with Discord | Wilderness Odyssey</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="staff login-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#login-main">Skip to sign-in</a>
    <header class="staff-header"><a class="staff-brand" href="/">Wilderness Odyssey<small>Survivor network</small></a><a href="/support/">Get help</a></header>
    <main id="login-main" class="odyssey-login">
      <section class="login-landscape" aria-labelledby="expedition-title">
        <p class="ops-kicker">Echo Earth / Survivor access</p>
        <h2 id="expedition-title">The world<br />left behind.<br /><em>Your story ahead.</em></h2>
        <p>Beyond the bunker doors, something is still worth finding.</p>
        <div class="landscape-ridge landscape-ridge--far" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="landscape-ridge landscape-ridge--near" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="landscape-footer">Wilderness Odyssey<br /><span>Project Threshold · Survivor network</span></p>
      </section>
      <section class="login-panel" aria-labelledby="signin-title">
        <p class="ops-kicker">Welcome back</p>
        <h1 id="signin-title">Sign in with Discord</h1>
        <p>Choose your space in the Odyssey.</p>
        <p class="staff-message" data-login-message role="status" hidden></p>
        <form action="/api/participant/start" method="get" data-login-form>
          <fieldset class="login-roles" data-login-roles disabled hidden>
            <legend class="visually-hidden">Your destination</legend>
            <label><input type="radio" name="destination" value="playtester" checked data-login-role /><span>Playtester<small>Playtests & your journey</small></span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="destination" value="admin" data-login-role /><span>Administrator<small>Manage the Odyssey</small></span></label>
          </fieldset>
          <label class="remember-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="remember" value="true" />Stay signed in on this device</label>
          <p class="ops-muted" data-remember-duration>Remember this device for up to 30 days. Use this only on a device you trust.</p>
          <button class="login-continue" type="submit">Continue with Discord <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </form>
        <p class="ops-muted">Discord handles your sign-in. We never see your password.</p>
        <details data-playtester-help><summary>New to playtesting?</summary><p>Sign in with the Discord account staff invited, then reopen your private Discord invitation to claim access. Only the invited account can claim it.</p></details>
        <details data-admin-help hidden><summary>First time signing in as an administrator?</summary><p>Run <code>/dashboard enable</code> in the Wilderness Odyssey Discord server, then continue with Discord. You need current Administrator permission. Run <code>/dashboard disable</code> to revoke all your dashboard access.</p></details>
        <noscript><p>The form above signs in playtesters. Administrators can <a href="/api/auth/discord/start">sign in with Discord here</a>, or <a href="/api/auth/discord/start?remember=true">stay signed in for up to 7 days</a>. Run <code>/dashboard enable</code> first. JavaScript is required to use either dashboard.</p></noscript>
        <nav class="login-footer" aria-label="Login links"><a href="/">← Back to website</a><a href="/status/">Server status</a></nav>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script src="../../scripts/login.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>
